00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:11.204 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Oui.

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:12.472 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- D'autres hôpitaux devront

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:13.740 size:53% position:73% line:53%
