00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:15.008 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Sacré-Coeur approche

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:16.276 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du point de saturation.

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:17.544 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ça fait 2 ans qu'on fait ça.

00:01:15.342 --> 00:01:18.812 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Et contrairement aux vagues

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:20.080 size:53% position:73% line:53%
précédentes, le problème

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:21.381 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ne touche plus seulement

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:23.083 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les soins intensifs.

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:24.217 size:53% position:73% line:53%
On compte beaucoup plus de

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:25.218 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 cas bénins, ce qui submerge

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:26.519 size:53% position:73% line:53%
