00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:28.822 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Dre VICKY SOULIÈRE, cardiologue,

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:30.090 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Hôpital du Sacré-Coeur

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:31.358 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On a commencé par remplir

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:32.625 size:53% position:73% line:53%
