00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:33.927 size:53% position:73% line:53%
On les a laissées un peu à part.

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:35.195 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Puis, progressivement,

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:36.463 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au fur et à mesure que

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:38.498 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les patients ont augmenté...

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:39.766 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on a fini par, en fait,

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:41.034 size:53% position:73% line:53%
remplir le module au complet.

00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:42.302 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Une soixantaine de lits

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:43.570 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de pneumologie transformés

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:44.838 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en lits COVID. On y isole

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:46.106 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des patients qui ne sont

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:47.374 size:53% position:73% line:53%
