00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:53.546 size:53% position:73% line:53%
infectés.

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:54.814 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La moitié des COVID

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:56.082 size:53% position:73% line:53%
viennent pas pour la COVID,

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:57.350 size:53% position:73% line:53%
