00:01:57.684 --> 00:02:01.154 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on gère des isolements!

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:02.422 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est un peu... je pense que

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:03.690 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est la vague de la gestion

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:04.958 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des isolements. Des isolements

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:06.259 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des patients qui viennent pour

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:07.494 size:53% position:73% line:53%
autre chose et l'isolemement

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:08.762 size:53% position:73% line:53%
