00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:17.670 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On attend aujourd'hui...

00:02:15.435 --> 00:02:18.938 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Juste à côté, en cardiologie,

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:20.206 size:53% position:73% line:53%
situation semblable. La moitié

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:21.474 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des lits sont occupés par des

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:22.742 size:53% position:73% line:53%
patients infectés par la COVID.

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:24.010 size:53% position:73% line:53%
GEORGES EL KHOURY, infirmier-

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:25.278 size:53% position:73% line:53%
chef, Hôpital du Sacré-Coeur

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:26.546 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Présentement : 12 lits de

00:02:24.344 --> 00:02:27.814 size:53% position:73% line:53%
