00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:29.082 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Donc, c'est vraiment

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:30.083 size:53% position:73% line:53%
50 % de notre département

00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:31.351 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de COVID positifs de

00:02:29.416 --> 00:02:32.852 size:53% position:73% line:53%
